    "result_text": "All 269 tests pass, BUILD SUCCESS.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented the registration-date default for owner creation:\n\n- **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added an optional `registrationDate` field (`type: string, format: date`) to the `OwnerFields` schema, so it's accepted on input and surfaces in the `Owner` response (via the existing `allOf`). The OpenAPI generator produces `LocalDate`, which Jackson serializes as ISO `YYYY-MM-DD`.\n- **`Owner.java`** \u2014 added a `registrationDate` (`LocalDate`) property mapped to a new `registration_date` column. MapStruct maps it automatically by name in both directions.\n- **`BuildOwner.java`** \u2014 after mapping the request, defaults `registrationDate` to `LocalDate.now()` when the client didn't supply one.\n- **DB schemas** (`hsqldb`, `h2`, `mysql`, `postgres`) \u2014 added the `registration_date DATE` column to the `owners` table.\n\nThe new `Cp08Tests` (creates an owner without a date, then asserts `GET` returns `registrationDate` = today) passes, and the full suite (269 tests) remains green.",
